            "subject": "Remittance advice: invoice MAR-7107",
            "body": "We have paid invoice MAR-7107 for $7,063.00 by bank transfer to the account on file.\n\nBrackwater Industrial Supply, Accounts Payable",
            "related_type": "invoice",
            "related_id": "MAR-7107"
          }
        }
